{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2023-04-18 15:51:00', 'title': 'GE AEROSPACE AND AJW GROUP SIGN SYSTEMS SERVICES AGREEMENT', 'text': "EVENDALE, OHIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GE AEROSPACE HAS SIGNED AN AGREEMENT WITH AJW GROUP TO SUPPORT AVIONICS AND ELECTRICAL POWER SYSTEMS ACROSS THE B777, B737 AND A320/30/40 FAMILY OF AIRCRAFT. THE CONTRACT WILL START THIS YEAR AND WILL COVER ALL AJW GROUP'S EUROPE, MIDDLE EAST, AND AFRICA (EMEA) CUSTOMERS THAT FLY THE B777, B737 AND A320/30/40 FAMILY OF AIRCRAFT."}